{"id": "DfR6cllSLtW", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Shani Dev ki nazar itni bhaari kyun hai? Yeh shraap unhe kisi dushman ne nahi, unki apni patni ne diya tha.\n\nBrahma Vaivarta Purana ke Ganapati Khanda mein Shani Dev khud Maa Parvati ko yeh baat batate hain. Woh Krishna ke dhyan mein the, patni unke paas aayin, aur unhone unki taraf dekha hi nahi. Patni ne kaha, \"Tumne mujhe nahi dekha, ab tum jise dekhoge, woh nasht ho jayega.\"\n\nIsiliye Shani Dev sar jhuka kar rehte hain.\n\nLekin us din Maa Parvati ne unse kaha ki mere bete ko dekho. Aage kya hua, Part 2 mein.\n\nPart 1 of 3. Pure sources pinned comment mein hain.\n\nAapne yeh katha pehle suni thi? 👇\n\n#shanidev #shani #ganesh #katha #sanatandharma", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1793710249, "like_count": 4485, "comment_count": 42, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2230488484175639a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.763, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPF51Z-GP9EXGR6sg7aAhWwa7h0oTAGGYSIQ0HqGGCr7CgjOmoE7Wq_0ZPMphXZopdGxu5tGNO0_yrRjgE7Ccx_vUU-Draauo_iDlQ.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Adp7EzpxzLdjaPCFueKp5DXSfoCRxQfZ3wpcI8SebIQ9RN9WKUrrPdhmMf5KPqlR9JsslwlPgG2R3PMKmP1y7IcL&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=ZYukAQYaErgQ7kNvwFUZSen&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=_EfrVeFFpTlzU1Co4meNEQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRmOM0NG8Q1yyDhS7axfZE422mpOmn0Z9rr-l275Rv6ug&oe=6AF4449B", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 63.763, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Acce